# Keep one canonical byte sequence for every checkout.
#
# The harness pins third-party snapshots by content hash (see
# tests/test_skills.py and third_party/sources.json). A `core.autocrlf=true`
# checkout rewrites CRLF into those files and every pinned digest fails, so
# snapshots are treated as binary: git never converts them.
* text=auto eol=lf

third_party/** -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
